comments.body:
@vanderaj has previously said that he wants to wait until after the next version of the OWASP Top 10 is released to produce ASVS 4.1

The target release date for the next OWASP Top 10 is mid-Feb 2021 so I doubt we will see a 4.1 before the end of April 2021.

Not currently clear whether there will be a 4.0.2 for now.
